ArgoCD
	ArgoCD Administrator account, after the initial creation of ArgoCD should be disabled and never be in use. 

	k get cm -A | grep argo
	k describe cm <cm_name> -n <namespace_probably_argocd>
	look for admin.enabled: "true"

	Simply add admin.enabled: "false" to the argo-cm ConfigMap, to disable the ArgoCD Administrator

